A Kindai Eiga-Nihon Eiga Shinsha Production

3
00:00:41,917 --> 00:00:46,963
BLACK CAT

4
00:00:52,302 --> 00:00:55,972
Produced by Nobuyo Horiba , Setsuo Noto and Kazuo Kuwabara

5
00:00:56,807 --> 00:00:59,392
Screenplay by Kaneto Shindo

6
00:00:59,977 --> 00:01:03,938
Cinematography by Kiyomi Kuroda Music by Hikaru Hayashi

7
00:01:04,481 --> 00:01:07,567
Production Design by Takashi Marumo and Norimichi Ikawa

8
00:01:07,693 --> 00:01:09,694
Edited by Hisao Enoki

9
00:01:32,843 --> 00:01:35,428
Starring

10
00:01:36,305 --> 00:01:40,391
Kichiemon Nakamura

11
00:01:40,809 --> 00:01:44,729
Nobuko Otowa

12
00:01:45,355 --> 00:01:47,690
Kel Sato , Rokko Toura

13
00:01:47,816 --> 00:01:49,776
Kiwako Taichi

14
00:01:50,527 --> 00:01:52,779
Taiji Tonoyama , Hideo Kanze

15
00:01:52,946 --> 00:01:56,365
Hideaki Esumi Shoji Oki , Kentaro Kaji

16
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:08,878
Directed by Kaneto Shindo

17
00:08:59,289 --> 00:09:02,208
Rajomon Gate

18
00:10:21,246 --> 00:10:23,122
Who are you ?

19
00:10:24,624 --> 00:10:28,877
You must be a ghost to be wandering alone so late at night .

20
00:10:29,254 --> 00:10:32,756
No , I am no such thing .

21
00:10:33,300 --> 00:10:37,970
I was at Lord Fujiwara 's mansion on some business ,

22
00:10:38,847 --> 00:10:41,724
but I 'm afraid of that grove ahead .

23
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:44,393
My legs are trembling .

24
00:10:48,023 --> 00:10:50,816
The capital is indeed pandemonium these days ,

25
00:10:50,984 --> 00:10:53,485
filled at night with bandits and thieves .

26
00:10:55,989 --> 00:10:57,990
Please help me .

27
00:10:58,992 --> 00:11:03,662
Will you see me to the far side of the grove ?

28
00:11:03,788 --> 00:11:07,333
And what if I 'm a bandit myself ?

29
00:11:07,667 --> 00:11:12,087
Such a fine samurai could not be a bandit .

30
00:11:12,464 --> 00:11:16,175
I assumed you were one of the renowned vassals

31
00:11:16,301 --> 00:11:20,095
of the illustrious warrior Raiko .

32
00:11:20,847 --> 00:11:23,849
Please help me .

33
00:11:25,560 --> 00:11:28,687
Very well . It 's out of my way ,

34
00:11:28,855 --> 00:11:32,441
but I 'm already late , so the delay won 't matter .

35
00:11:33,193 --> 00:11:35,235
Thank you .

36
00:12:24,869 --> 00:12:26,537
Woman .

37
00:12:27,247 --> 00:12:29,748
You walk so quickly .

38
00:12:30,208 --> 00:12:33,210
It is a familiar road .

39
00:12:37,757 --> 00:12:39,925
Was that a cat ?

40
00:12:48,309 --> 00:12:50,227
Is ...

41
00:12:50,437 --> 00:12:51,979
anything wrong ?

42
00:12:53,022 --> 00:12:56,650
There you are . I wondered where you 'd gone .

43
00:12:56,776 --> 00:12:59,611
I heard a cat cry .

44
00:13:01,489 --> 00:13:03,615
A cat 's nothing to be afraid of .

45
00:13:03,741 --> 00:13:05,784
My heart started pounding .

46
00:13:05,952 --> 00:13:07,870
Even cats are starving these days .

47
00:13:07,996 --> 00:13:11,915
Flocks of black crows along the bed of the Kamo River

48
00:13:12,041 --> 00:13:15,669
peck at the corpses of those who 've starved .

49
00:13:28,975 --> 00:13:30,976
Thank you .

50
00:13:31,144 --> 00:13:35,314
You live in a very secluded spot . It seems very peaceful .

51
00:13:35,523 --> 00:13:38,066
We have nothing to offer you ,

52
00:13:38,193 --> 00:13:42,279
but you 're welcome to come in for a while .

53
00:13:44,491 --> 00:13:46,200
Well , let me see ...

54
00:13:46,701 --> 00:13:50,996
There 's nobody here but Mother and I.

55
00:13:51,164 --> 00:13:54,958
Perhaps I 'll accept your kind offer .

56
00:13:55,668 --> 00:13:57,252
Please do .

57
00:14:01,508 --> 00:14:03,175
This way , please .

58
00:14:21,611 --> 00:14:23,820
Quite a splendid residence .

59
00:14:29,452 --> 00:14:32,037
Far better than my own .

60
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:36,959
It 's like the home of a court noble .

61
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:42,923
Is anything wrong ?

62
00:14:45,134 --> 00:14:47,469
I felt a slight chill .

63
00:14:48,179 --> 00:14:51,848
We only use this room when we have guests .

64
00:14:52,725 --> 00:14:55,852
It must feel cold from being so empty .

65
00:14:57,564 --> 00:15:00,065
I think your being here

66
00:15:00,775 --> 00:15:03,652
will soon fill the room with warmth .

67
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:09,157
Strange things happen in a war-torn land .

68
00:15:09,742 --> 00:15:11,868
Hail fell this summer .

69
00:15:11,995 --> 00:15:15,831
Then it suddenly grew so hot that birds fell from the sky .

70
00:15:50,199 --> 00:15:52,409
Allow me to present my mother .

71
00:15:55,038 --> 00:16:01,001
Thank you for being so kind to my daughter .

72
00:16:06,466 --> 00:16:07,924
Not at all .

73
00:16:08,051 --> 00:16:12,137
I enjoyed the night breeze along the way .

74
00:16:14,766 --> 00:16:18,977
I feel like I 've met you two somewhere before .

75
00:16:20,897 --> 00:16:22,898
What an amusing thought .

76
00:16:23,524 --> 00:16:25,025
Isn 't it , Mother ?

77
00:16:29,238 --> 00:16:33,533
I 'm certain I have . I just can 't recall where .

78
00:16:33,660 --> 00:16:36,328
Serve our guest some sake .

79
00:17:14,826 --> 00:17:16,368
Wasn 't that a cat ?

80
00:17:16,494 --> 00:17:18,745
It must be a stray .

81
00:17:18,996 --> 00:17:21,331
Please have some more .

82
00:17:22,583 --> 00:17:24,793
Excuse me ...

83
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:27,921
but may I ask your age ?

84
00:17:29,674 --> 00:17:30,674
What ?

85
00:17:31,759 --> 00:17:35,178
I also have a son .

86
00:17:35,763 --> 00:17:40,600
You look to be almost the same age .

87
00:17:42,687 --> 00:17:44,688
I am 22 .

88
00:17:45,773 --> 00:17:48,066
My husband is 21 .

89
00:17:51,237 --> 00:17:55,073
Where is your son ? Serving at court ?

90
00:17:55,742 --> 00:17:57,826
He went off to war .

91
00:17:57,952 --> 00:17:59,661
Off to war ?

92
00:17:59,787 --> 00:18:04,791
Yes , three years ago . He has not returned .

93
00:18:05,918 --> 00:18:08,128
Under whom is he serving ?

94
00:18:08,254 --> 00:18:12,841
We do not know .

95
00:18:13,843 --> 00:18:16,845
He left just as we finished planting a spring crop .

96
00:18:16,971 --> 00:18:18,638
You ? Planting ?

97
00:18:18,931 --> 00:18:20,223
Yes .

98
00:18:20,892 --> 00:18:24,186
In this age of war , we must sow crops ourselves

99
00:18:24,312 --> 00:18:26,938
to keep from starving .

100
00:18:28,357 --> 00:18:31,359
Suddenly a group of soldiers came by .

101
00:18:32,153 --> 00:18:36,782
My son was taken away , plow still in his hands .

102
00:18:37,825 --> 00:18:39,618
No need to worry , then .

103
00:18:39,786 --> 00:18:43,872
I 'm sure he 's a fine samurai somewhere by now .

104
00:18:44,832 --> 00:18:46,750
Somewhere , you say ?

105
00:18:48,795 --> 00:18:53,673
He may be far to the north in Ezo , or to the south in Tsukushi .

106
00:18:54,926 --> 00:18:57,803
The entire land is torn by warfare .

107
00:18:58,012 --> 00:19:03,350
His absence means he 's too busy and successful to return home .

108
00:19:03,893 --> 00:19:05,519
Don 't worry .

109
00:19:05,645 --> 00:19:08,188
He was lucky to be taken off to war .

110
00:19:08,606 --> 00:19:11,316
It 's a samurai 's world now .

111
00:19:12,985 --> 00:19:16,154
The court nobles are incapable of warfare ,

112
00:19:16,447 --> 00:19:19,658
so samurai are poised to rule the land .

113
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:26,873
Even the emperor will answer to our master Raiko one day .

114
00:19:27,917 --> 00:19:32,212
I used to be a farmer in the mountains of Kawachi ,

115
00:19:32,880 --> 00:19:37,592
but the war has allowed me to rise to what I am today .

116
00:19:40,137 --> 00:19:42,055
Don 't worry .

117
00:19:42,181 --> 00:19:46,518
Fighting allows us to eat our fill and have whatever we desire .

118
00:19:46,686 --> 00:19:50,480
We samurai can take whatever we want !

119
00:19:54,819 --> 00:19:56,695
Where 'd your mother go ?

120
00:19:57,530 --> 00:20:01,199
Perhaps she thought it best to leave us alone .

121
00:20:36,694 --> 00:20:38,361
I 'm drunk .

122
00:20:39,739 --> 00:20:41,615
The sake 's very good .

123
00:20:41,908 --> 00:20:45,535
Please make yourself at home .

124
00:25:04,628 --> 00:25:06,838
I am glad you have come .

125
00:25:11,677 --> 00:25:13,970
That 's good sake !

126
00:25:16,098 --> 00:25:18,683
Please make yourself at home .

127
00:28:15,611 --> 00:28:17,236
Excuse me .

128
00:29:25,013 --> 00:29:27,932
RAJOMON GATE

129
00:29:29,309 --> 00:29:32,645
The chief of the imperial police is coming !

130
00:29:38,652 --> 00:29:40,236
Move aside !

131
00:30:13,687 --> 00:30:20,610
Raiko Minamoto , you are the leader of the samurai .

132
00:30:21,320 --> 00:30:25,656
This is a disgrace .

133
00:30:29,077 --> 00:30:33,915
Are you simply going to sit back and watch

134
00:30:34,041 --> 00:30:38,044
as this ghost appears night after night at Rajomon Gate ?

135
00:30:39,338 --> 00:30:42,507
Only one who takes pride in his martial prowess

136
00:30:42,674 --> 00:30:47,345
may be called " leader of the samurai . "

137
00:30:50,349 --> 00:30:52,808
As things stand ,

138
00:30:52,935 --> 00:30:58,314
this ghost could appear in the imperial palace at any moment .

139
00:30:59,024 --> 00:31:04,612
I cannot sleep peacefully at night .

140
00:31:19,878 --> 00:31:22,588
He says to me in that exalted voice ,

141
00:31:22,965 --> 00:31:26,634
" I cannot sleep peacefully at night . "

142
00:31:26,843 --> 00:31:28,344
Shit !

143
00:31:28,470 --> 00:31:32,098
Who 's running all over the country fighting his wars ?

144
00:31:33,267 --> 00:31:35,560
Me , Raiko Minamoto !

145
00:31:36,687 --> 00:31:40,106
The courtiers kick balls around and play board games .

146
00:31:40,232 --> 00:31:43,568
They write songs and fool around with women .

147
00:31:45,279 --> 00:31:48,072
Don 't tell anyone I said this .

148
00:31:51,076 --> 00:31:53,369
It 's maddening .

149
00:31:54,246 --> 00:31:57,873
I assure you , this " ghost " is no supernatural being .

150
00:31:58,000 --> 00:32:01,252
It 's surely an animal or night prowler .

151
00:32:01,920 --> 00:32:03,296
Summon Kintoki Sakata !

152
00:32:03,797 --> 00:32:06,757
He just deployed to the west .

153
00:32:09,344 --> 00:32:10,761
Summon Tsuna Watanabe !

154
00:32:10,929 --> 00:32:13,764
He 's fighting in the east .

155
00:32:13,932 --> 00:32:16,517
Fool ! I know that !

156
00:32:17,352 --> 00:32:20,479
I 'm just trying to rouse you cowards to action !

157
00:32:21,273 --> 00:32:23,941
Isn 't there anyone willing to kill this monster ?

158
00:32:24,943 --> 00:32:28,487
EZO - NORTHERN JAPAN

159
00:35:55,570 --> 00:35:59,490
You took Sunehiko the Bear 's head ? Let me see it .

160
00:36:16,550 --> 00:36:18,509
You sure it was him ?

161
00:36:19,845 --> 00:36:22,096
He identified himself .

162
00:36:22,222 --> 00:36:25,724
He also wore fine armor and carried an iron club !

163
00:36:26,685 --> 00:36:28,310
Good .

164
00:36:28,436 --> 00:36:32,648
Then it really is his head . You 've accomplished a great feat .

165
00:36:34,276 --> 00:36:37,194
What happened to General Takemaro Fujiwara ?

166
00:36:37,362 --> 00:36:39,029
He died in battle !

167
00:36:39,155 --> 00:36:41,365
And my 2,000 men ?

168
00:36:41,533 --> 00:36:44,368
They all died . And all the enemy too .

169
00:36:45,245 --> 00:36:47,580
Give me a detailed account .

170
00:36:47,998 --> 00:36:51,876
It was muddy as a rice paddy , and thick with reeds .

171
00:36:52,127 --> 00:36:55,212
The enemy lured us into the reeds .

172
00:36:55,714 --> 00:36:59,091
The battle began at dawn and ended at dusk .

173
00:36:59,217 --> 00:37:02,094
By then , only he and I were left .

174
00:37:03,471 --> 00:37:08,642
He really was as hairy as a bear . I couldn 't believe it .

175
00:37:09,269 --> 00:37:14,273
It had to be him . He confirmed it by stating his name .

176
00:37:15,275 --> 00:37:17,443
He told me to identify myself ,

177
00:37:17,569 --> 00:37:19,862
but I don 't have a battle name yet .

178
00:37:19,988 --> 00:37:23,741
I remembered Kintoki Sakata , so I decided on " Gintoki "

179
00:37:23,867 --> 00:37:25,910
but couldn 't think of a last name .

180
00:37:26,036 --> 00:37:30,706
I was born in a house in a grove , so I said " Gintoki of the Grove . "

181
00:37:30,832 --> 00:37:34,376
He said my name sounded courageous .

182
00:37:34,502 --> 00:37:39,632
He assumed I was a famous general and challenged me to fight .

183
00:37:39,925 --> 00:37:43,260
The son of a bitch was strong as hell !

184
00:37:43,428 --> 00:37:45,638
Like a demon with an iron club !

185
00:37:46,014 --> 00:37:49,892
I was sure I 'd wind up as rust on that club .

186
00:37:50,101 --> 00:37:53,854
I didn 't want to die there in the mud , so I summoned my courage .

187
00:37:53,980 --> 00:37:56,482
After a long battle , I finally took his head !

188
00:38:01,988 --> 00:38:05,908
From now on , you will be Gintoki of the Grove .

189
00:38:06,826 --> 00:38:11,205
I have four trusted retainers . You will be the fifth .

190
00:39:51,639 --> 00:39:53,390
Jimbei , it 's me !

191
00:39:58,063 --> 00:40:01,231
I 'm Hachi , Yone 's son . From the other end of the grove .

192
00:40:02,150 --> 00:40:03,734
You 're -

193
00:40:03,943 --> 00:40:05,903
What happened to my house ?

194
00:40:06,071 --> 00:40:08,572
It 's burned down . There 's nothing left .

195
00:40:08,698 --> 00:40:11,575
Yes , you 're Hachi all right .

196
00:40:11,743 --> 00:40:13,744
But why are you dressed like that ?

197
00:40:13,870 --> 00:40:15,454
Never mind that .

198
00:40:15,580 --> 00:40:19,625
What happened to my house ? Where are my mother and wife ?

199
00:40:21,586 --> 00:40:24,254
It was last summer .

200
00:40:24,380 --> 00:40:27,549
Kyoto burned for three days and nights .

201
00:40:28,093 --> 00:40:32,554
Conqueror and conquered alike set homes on fire .

202
00:40:32,680 --> 00:40:35,474
War sends everything up in flames .

203
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:39,103
Sparks fell even here .

204
00:40:39,270 --> 00:40:42,940
Fearing for our lives , we fled into the mountains .

205
00:40:43,233 --> 00:40:46,568
When we came back ,

206
00:40:46,694 --> 00:40:50,447
your home had burned to ash .

207
00:40:50,782 --> 00:40:56,620
We don 't know if your mother and wife burned to death or fled .

208
00:40:56,788 --> 00:41:00,082
We haven 't seen them since .

209
00:41:00,625 --> 00:41:03,836
We don 't even know how the house burned down .

210
00:41:32,407 --> 00:41:33,532
Mother !

211
00:41:35,243 --> 00:41:36,994
Shige !

212
00:41:37,162 --> 00:41:39,621
Where did you go ?

213
00:41:51,426 --> 00:41:53,886
You 've won great distinction .

214
00:41:55,054 --> 00:41:58,307
Your valor is known throughout the capital .

215
00:41:58,808 --> 00:42:03,395
Even beggars speak of what a strong samurai you are .

216
00:42:03,688 --> 00:42:06,190
Isn 't that right ? - Yes .

217
00:42:06,357 --> 00:42:11,069
Young girls are especially smitten with him .

218
00:42:11,487 --> 00:42:14,531
They all hope to glimpse his face .

219
00:42:14,908 --> 00:42:20,329
The bravest man in the capital must behave accordingly .

220
00:42:21,456 --> 00:42:23,373
This is my order :

221
00:42:23,499 --> 00:42:27,961
Find the monster that 's been feasting on the necks of my samurai

222
00:42:28,087 --> 00:42:29,755
and exterminate it .

223
00:42:31,382 --> 00:42:35,761
My name is at stake . You must not fail .

224
00:42:36,387 --> 00:42:39,556
Very well . I offer you my cup .

225
00:42:39,891 --> 00:42:41,683
Pour for him .

226
00:42:57,492 --> 00:43:00,160
Gintoki , what about women ?

227
00:43:01,913 --> 00:43:03,872
Do you find them beautiful ?

228
00:43:06,501 --> 00:43:08,001
Yes , I do .

229
00:43:08,127 --> 00:43:09,670
Very well .

230
00:43:09,796 --> 00:43:13,173
When you 've killed the monster ,

231
00:43:13,299 --> 00:43:18,512
I 'll give you any woman you want , so do your best .

232
00:44:21,367 --> 00:44:23,827
Woman , what 's the matter ?

233
00:44:26,539 --> 00:44:29,041
Are you afraid to walk alone at night ?

234
00:44:38,176 --> 00:44:42,554
There 's a dark grove ahead . Are you returning home that way ?

235
00:44:45,016 --> 00:44:48,143
So am I. I will see you home .

236
00:44:49,604 --> 00:45:55,252
Thank you .

237
00:45:55,420 --> 00:45:57,712
This is your home ?

238
00:45:57,922 --> 00:45:59,506
Yes .

239
00:46:00,133 --> 00:46:02,926
I live here with my mother .

240
00:46:03,636 --> 00:46:07,848
My home is far from here . May I rest a bit ?

241
00:46:14,355 --> 00:46:16,940
Well ? May I rest here a while ?

242
00:46:36,961 --> 00:46:39,379
Welcome .

243
00:46:46,512 --> 00:46:49,473
It was good of you to come .

244
00:46:50,808 --> 00:46:52,976
This way , please .

245
00:47:32,892 --> 00:47:37,229
Are your names Yone and Shige , by any chance ?

246
00:47:43,069 --> 00:47:45,362
Forgive me for being so direct .

247
00:47:45,947 --> 00:47:49,491
You look exactly like my mother and wife ,

248
00:47:49,617 --> 00:47:51,535
though you 're dressed differently .

249
00:47:52,912 --> 00:47:56,289
Where are they now ?

250
00:47:57,833 --> 00:48:02,629
Three years ago , I was conscripted to fight barbarians in the east .

251
00:48:03,464 --> 00:48:06,174
I was dragged away from the fields ,

252
00:48:06,842 --> 00:48:09,427
leaving my mother and wife left behind .

253
00:48:12,848 --> 00:48:16,184
I wanted to return to them ,

254
00:48:16,727 --> 00:48:20,397
so I fought as hard as I could .

255
00:48:24,026 --> 00:48:25,986
I couldn 't allow myself to die .

256
00:48:26,404 --> 00:48:29,030
I got unexpectedly lucky on the battlefield .

257
00:48:29,156 --> 00:48:32,492
Raiko dubbed me Gintoki of the Grove .

258
00:48:36,205 --> 00:48:40,750
But when I went home , my house was no longer there .

259
00:48:40,918 --> 00:48:44,504
It had burned down . My mother and wife were gone .

260
00:48:51,137 --> 00:48:53,263
This is quite strange .

261
00:48:54,432 --> 00:48:59,060
You two look exactly like my mother and wife .

262
00:49:00,354 --> 00:49:05,734
I do not know where they may be ,

263
00:49:06,277 --> 00:49:12,115
but just as you fought day and night in order to return to them ,

264
00:49:12,617 --> 00:49:15,368
your mother and wife too

265
00:49:15,494 --> 00:49:20,081
must have waited day and night for your return .

266
00:49:24,170 --> 00:49:29,883
You have returned from war in triumph .

267
00:49:31,969 --> 00:49:34,804
But I wonder what has become of them .

268
00:49:36,641 --> 00:49:40,769
My house was at the edge of a bamboo grove ...

269
00:49:42,396 --> 00:49:44,481
not far from here .

270
00:49:46,275 --> 00:49:48,693
How long have you lived here ?

271
00:49:51,447 --> 00:49:53,657
Three years .

272
00:49:53,783 --> 00:49:55,742
Since I left for war ?

273
00:49:56,786 --> 00:49:59,996
Yes , that 's correct .

274
00:50:01,666 --> 00:50:03,917
Is there some reason

275
00:50:04,043 --> 00:50:07,045
you live in such a secluded place ?

276
00:50:08,881 --> 00:50:12,217
We 're just a poor mother and daughter .

277
00:50:12,343 --> 00:50:16,554
We wish to live quietly , far from prying eyes .

278
00:50:17,014 --> 00:50:21,434
If you came here three years ago , you must have seen my house .

279
00:50:27,108 --> 00:50:29,776
Or at least the charred ruins ?

280
00:50:40,037 --> 00:50:41,871
Who are you ?

281
00:50:44,875 --> 00:50:47,001
Show your true selves , ghosts of Rajomon !

282
00:51:11,318 --> 00:51:13,236
There 's no doubt you 're ghosts !

283
00:51:13,404 --> 00:51:16,614
Why have you taken the forms of my mother and wife ?

284
00:51:23,497 --> 00:51:26,583
RAJOMON GATE

285
00:52:09,001 --> 00:52:10,502
Women !

286
00:52:14,048 --> 00:52:16,174
Are you here ?

287
00:52:39,114 --> 00:52:42,242
Women ! Come out if you 're here !

288
00:52:45,412 --> 00:52:48,456
Women , where are you ?

289
00:52:51,836 --> 00:52:56,339
I didn 't come to kill you ! I came to see you !

290
00:53:16,110 --> 00:53:17,735
Women !

291
00:53:21,073 --> 00:53:29,914
Are you here ?

292
00:54:03,198 --> 00:54:07,577
You must want to see him .

293
00:54:10,039 --> 00:54:12,707
I want to see him too .

294
00:54:47,618 --> 00:54:53,122
We vowed to kill samurai and drink their blood .

295
00:54:54,249 --> 00:54:58,252
We prayed to the spirits of heaven and earth to let us do so .

296
00:55:00,798 --> 00:55:04,384
If only he weren 't a samurai ...

297
00:55:37,001 --> 00:55:39,002
Try to bear it .

298
00:55:40,295 --> 00:55:42,130
Try to endure .

299
00:55:43,507 --> 00:55:45,341
Be content ...

300
00:55:45,926 --> 00:55:51,222
to watch him secretly from afar .

301
00:56:08,198 --> 00:56:09,907
It 's him !

302
00:56:25,090 --> 00:56:26,758
Are you here ?

303
00:56:27,551 --> 00:56:29,218
Are you ?

304
00:56:31,138 --> 00:56:32,805
Where are you ?

305
00:56:35,893 --> 00:56:37,727
Where have you gone ?

306
00:56:59,458 --> 00:57:01,751
Ah , you 've come !

307
00:57:50,008 --> 00:57:52,426
It was good of you to come .

308
00:57:58,016 --> 00:58:00,518
We have nothing to offer ,

309
00:58:01,436 --> 00:58:06,440
but allow us to celebrate your safe return home .

310
00:58:09,361 --> 00:58:11,487
Serve our guest .

311
00:58:57,367 --> 00:59:01,370
I will no longer ask who you are .

312
00:59:04,374 --> 00:59:08,628
I simply wanted to see you . That 's the only reason I 'm here .

313
00:59:12,007 --> 00:59:14,550
You look exactly like my mother ,

314
00:59:14,718 --> 00:59:17,220
and you look exactly like my wife .

315
00:59:17,763 --> 00:59:21,015
That 's enough for me .

316
00:59:24,436 --> 00:59:28,648
I 'm truly happy to see you . I 've missed you both .

317
00:59:29,441 --> 00:59:33,736
We wished to see you too .

318
00:59:35,948 --> 00:59:38,908
Dawn is a long way off .

319
00:59:40,410 --> 00:59:44,330
Please make yourself comfortable .

320
01:00:16,446 --> 01:00:18,281
I missed you .

321
01:00:53,608 --> 01:00:55,651
Is that your cat ?

322
01:00:56,236 --> 01:01:00,781
No , it 's a stray whose owner died .

323
01:01:01,616 --> 01:01:03,159
That reminds me .

324
01:01:03,327 --> 01:01:08,289
When I was taken off to war , we had a black kitten at home .

325
01:01:13,962 --> 01:01:15,838
Never mind .

326
01:01:16,298 --> 01:01:19,008
Let 's forget about the past .

327
01:05:04,776 --> 01:05:06,277
Pardon me .

328
01:05:12,367 --> 01:05:14,910
It will soon be dawn .

329
01:05:15,537 --> 01:05:18,872
Please depart before then .

330
01:05:48,528 --> 01:05:50,404
I 'll come again .

331
01:05:52,073 --> 01:05:53,866
Will you wait ?

332
01:06:27,150 --> 01:06:32,696
You return empty-handed every night . Have you seen the monster ?

333
01:06:33,156 --> 01:06:37,576
Yes , I saw it , but -

334
01:06:38,953 --> 01:06:41,330
Why didn 't you kill it ?

335
01:06:41,623 --> 01:06:44,083
It 's just that -

336
01:06:44,793 --> 01:06:46,752
Couldn 't you do it ?

337
01:06:48,338 --> 01:06:49,546
It 's not that .

338
01:06:52,175 --> 01:06:54,593
You look pale .

339
01:06:56,012 --> 01:06:58,847
Like a ghost yourself .

340
01:07:11,361 --> 01:07:14,196
Has the ghost bewitched you ?

341
01:08:20,972 --> 01:08:27,102
Your breasts and legs are like Shige 's .

342
01:08:27,604 --> 01:08:29,271
You are Shige .

343
01:08:29,606 --> 01:08:31,565
You are my wife .

344
01:09:03,139 --> 01:09:07,518
Shige , I want to devour you !

345
01:09:07,894 --> 01:09:12,105
I want to chew you up and consume you !

346
01:09:42,846 --> 01:09:44,847
Hold me so tight it hurts .

347
01:09:44,973 --> 01:09:48,684
Tighter , my love !

348
01:10:35,523 --> 01:10:37,816
Ah , there you are .

349
01:10:39,736 --> 01:10:41,236
Where is she ?

350
01:11:05,803 --> 01:11:08,555
She is no longer here .

351
01:11:08,681 --> 01:11:11,266
What ? She 's not here ?

352
01:11:14,228 --> 01:11:15,729
Why ?

353
01:11:17,065 --> 01:11:19,066
What happened to her ?

354
01:11:29,452 --> 01:11:33,830
She was given seven days to see you

355
01:11:34,624 --> 01:11:37,542
and make love to you .

356
01:11:38,795 --> 01:11:41,129
Please count the days for yourself .

357
01:11:42,256 --> 01:11:45,092
Last night was the seventh .

358
01:11:52,809 --> 01:11:55,686
She shortened her life to seven days ...

359
01:11:56,813 --> 01:11:59,898
so that she could pledge her love to you .

360
01:12:04,445 --> 01:12:07,739
But you 're not living human beings !

361
01:12:09,158 --> 01:12:14,871
How can a being who isn 't even alive shorten her life to seven days ?

362
01:12:16,833 --> 01:12:19,001
Are you ghosts or aren 't you ?

363
01:12:19,168 --> 01:12:21,420
Whether spirits or ghosts ,

364
01:12:21,546 --> 01:12:25,757
isn 't it superhuman powers that give you human form ?

365
01:12:26,843 --> 01:12:30,971
How can a being with such powers die ?

366
01:12:34,642 --> 01:12:36,727
She 's not supposed to die !

367
01:12:44,485 --> 01:12:46,695
I want to see her once more !

368
01:12:50,116 --> 01:12:54,953
I am bound by a vow and cannot tell you who we are .

369
01:12:57,623 --> 01:13:01,168
We promised the god of evil ...

370
01:13:08,509 --> 01:13:13,597
the god of those who return from the netherworld to avenge past wrongs .

371
01:13:14,390 --> 01:13:17,142
We promised to get revenge by drinking blood ,

372
01:13:17,268 --> 01:13:20,937
and we were allowed to take human form .

373
01:13:24,067 --> 01:13:26,943
But she broke her promise .

374
01:13:30,406 --> 01:13:32,449
For the sake of our love ?

375
01:13:37,288 --> 01:13:39,206
You are my mother !

376
01:13:48,591 --> 01:13:50,425
She was really Shige !

377
01:13:55,848 --> 01:13:59,726
Tell me who killed you !

378
01:14:21,124 --> 01:14:23,625
We made a vow .

379
01:14:24,502 --> 01:14:27,754
We cannot reveal who we are ...

380
01:14:29,799 --> 01:14:32,968
or how we became like this .

381
01:14:33,261 --> 01:14:35,971
What exactly was your oath of vengeance ?

382
01:14:37,306 --> 01:14:40,016
To drink the blood of samurai .

383
01:14:42,645 --> 01:14:48,150
To drink the blood of every last samurai in the world .

384
01:14:52,613 --> 01:14:54,906
You too are a samurai .

385
01:14:55,908 --> 01:15:00,412
Instead of killing you ...

386
01:15:01,330 --> 01:15:03,915
she gave herself to you .

387
01:15:06,335 --> 01:15:08,503
Because of that ...

388
01:15:08,754 --> 01:15:12,382
she plunged headlong into hell .

389
01:15:14,594 --> 01:15:17,179
But she went willingly .

390
01:15:43,706 --> 01:15:46,208
Can 't I see her anymore ?

391
01:15:46,876 --> 01:15:49,252
Is she gone forever ?

392
01:15:52,381 --> 01:15:57,344
Instead of drinking the blood of hateful samurai ...

393
01:15:57,929 --> 01:16:02,140
she chose to love you and be banished to hell .

394
01:16:03,893 --> 01:16:05,560
Hateful samurai ?

395
01:16:09,398 --> 01:16:11,191
Tell me why !

396
01:16:13,653 --> 01:16:15,570
If only I could .

397
01:16:16,572 --> 01:16:20,909
But my vow to the god stops me .

398
01:16:22,620 --> 01:16:24,788
Please forgive me .

399
01:16:28,918 --> 01:16:30,543
Mother !

400
01:16:35,633 --> 01:16:37,884
What happened to you two ?

401
01:17:02,660 --> 01:17:05,370
You say you discovered the monster 's true identity ?

402
01:17:08,874 --> 01:17:13,461
In that case , you should have destroyed it .

403
01:17:14,880 --> 01:17:18,300
But we 'll discuss that later .

404
01:17:19,760 --> 01:17:23,680
For the time being , tell me what it is .

405
01:17:24,307 --> 01:17:29,185
It 's a vengeful ghost who was brutally murdered by samurai .

406
01:17:29,478 --> 01:17:35,650
That 's why it hates samurai and drinks their blood .

407
01:17:37,611 --> 01:17:39,988
The ghost told you that ?

408
01:17:41,407 --> 01:17:42,907
Fool !

409
01:17:45,369 --> 01:17:50,165
Samurai fight so nobles and peasants can live free from worry .

410
01:17:50,833 --> 01:17:54,085
How can anyone hate us ?

411
01:17:54,503 --> 01:17:59,257
Noblemen may benefit ,

412
01:17:59,383 --> 01:18:04,012
but farmers are forced to flee and often starve to death .

413
01:18:04,180 --> 01:18:06,389
The weak ones do .

414
01:18:06,515 --> 01:18:09,100
The weak always starve .

415
01:18:09,226 --> 01:18:14,022
We risk our lives to fight - that calls for courage !

416
01:18:14,190 --> 01:18:17,901
Isn 't that why everyone respects us ?

417
01:18:18,027 --> 01:18:20,070
Consider your own case .

418
01:18:20,196 --> 01:18:24,240
You were a dumb farmer 's son , but now you 're Gintoki of the Grove .

419
01:18:24,658 --> 01:18:28,787
Who cares about peasants , or even considers them human ?

420
01:18:32,208 --> 01:18:35,919
Women only dote on you because you 're a samurai .

421
01:18:36,837 --> 01:18:40,048
What ghost would dare hate us ?

422
01:18:40,591 --> 01:18:43,635
I won 't let some phantom make fools of us !

423
01:18:46,972 --> 01:18:49,808
As a samurai , I hereby order you :

424
01:18:50,601 --> 01:18:52,143
Destroy it !

425
01:18:54,438 --> 01:18:57,941
One of them has already perished .

426
01:18:58,317 --> 01:18:59,984
What 's that ?

427
01:19:00,653 --> 01:19:05,657
One has perished ? How many were there ?

428
01:19:08,035 --> 01:19:09,953
Two .

429
01:19:11,789 --> 01:19:13,456
And you destroyed one ?

430
01:19:21,090 --> 01:19:23,383
Show me proof .

431
01:19:27,721 --> 01:19:29,180
Well ?

432
01:19:30,683 --> 01:19:33,268
It is gone forever .

433
01:19:34,103 --> 01:19:36,646
Explain yourself . How did it perish ?

434
01:19:37,857 --> 01:19:39,774
It disappeared !

435
01:19:39,984 --> 01:19:42,861
It was a ghost ! There was nothing I could do !

436
01:19:42,987 --> 01:19:46,364
It disappeared from my sight !

437
01:19:47,700 --> 01:19:49,576
And there 's one left ?

438
01:19:51,662 --> 01:19:53,455
Destroy it .

439
01:19:54,957 --> 01:19:57,959
- Please order someone else - - Fool !

440
01:19:59,128 --> 01:20:02,797
If you let this one get away as well ...

441
01:20:03,215 --> 01:20:05,258
I 'll kill you .

442
01:20:07,344 --> 01:20:11,222
On my honor as a samurai , I will kill you !

443
01:21:23,295 --> 01:21:27,549
RAJOMON GATE

444
01:21:45,651 --> 01:21:48,278
Why didn 't you leave ?

445
01:21:51,490 --> 01:21:54,117
You 've been drinking blood every night .

446
01:21:54,702 --> 01:21:56,286
Why ?

447
01:21:59,707 --> 01:22:01,624
Why can 't you rest in peace ?

448
01:22:02,626 --> 01:22:04,836
I wanted to see you .

449
01:22:06,046 --> 01:22:09,757
I wanted to see you just once more .

450
01:22:11,468 --> 01:22:15,305
I 've lost my honor . I 'm going to be killed .

451
01:22:16,098 --> 01:22:22,645
I 've been driven to the point where I must destroy you or die !

452
01:22:24,106 --> 01:22:26,441
My plan was to see you once more

453
01:22:27,443 --> 01:22:31,154
and then follow her to hell .

454
01:22:31,614 --> 01:22:35,366
Well , now you 've seen me . Are you satisfied ?

455
01:22:36,660 --> 01:22:40,455
Please come to my abode .

456
01:22:40,956 --> 01:22:45,001
Will you read a sutra to me there ?

457
01:22:45,544 --> 01:22:48,129
Then I can rest in peace .

458
01:22:50,924 --> 01:22:52,717
Please .

459
01:22:52,926 --> 01:22:55,720
I have chosen a sacred sutra .

460
01:22:56,597 --> 01:23:02,477
If you read it to me , my hatred will be extinguished .

461
01:23:36,679 --> 01:23:40,264
There 's a puddle . Please be careful .

462
01:23:48,607 --> 01:23:50,400
Is something wrong ?

463
01:23:51,443 --> 01:23:52,985
No , nothing .

464
01:24:12,715 --> 01:24:14,048
What is it ?

465
01:24:14,383 --> 01:24:15,633
Nothing .

466
01:24:57,384 --> 01:24:59,385
So it was a black cat ?

467
01:25:00,429 --> 01:25:02,221
So it seems .

468
01:25:07,936 --> 01:25:10,271
You didn 't just pick this up somewhere ?

469
01:25:10,439 --> 01:25:14,150
You don 't find cat 's limbs just lying around .

470
01:25:14,985 --> 01:25:18,446
Don 't get angry . It was just a thought .

471
01:25:20,199 --> 01:25:23,826
But why would a cat hate samurai ?

472
01:25:29,082 --> 01:25:31,959
They once said there was a demon on Mount Oe ,

473
01:25:32,127 --> 01:25:35,004
so I went to slay it on the emperor 's orders .

474
01:25:35,589 --> 01:25:38,341
There are no such things as demons .

475
01:25:38,759 --> 01:25:41,719
It turned out to be the bandit Shuten Doji .

476
01:25:42,471 --> 01:25:47,558
There 's no glory in killing a bandit , so I said it was a demon .

477
01:25:50,145 --> 01:25:56,818
You 've slain a 1,000-year-old goblin cat the size of a cow .

478
01:25:57,945 --> 01:26:01,489
You must undergo ritual purification for seven days .

479
01:26:03,033 --> 01:26:07,328
We must make this the talk of the capital .

480
01:26:09,164 --> 01:26:10,957
Make a great show of it :

481
01:26:11,083 --> 01:26:14,418
ablutions , austerities and confinement .

482
01:26:47,202 --> 01:26:48,703
Mother ...

483
01:26:54,376 --> 01:26:56,377
are you a cat ?

484
01:26:57,880 --> 01:27:00,214
Are you really my mother ?

485
01:27:02,718 --> 01:27:23,404
Give it back .

486
01:27:31,204 --> 01:27:32,830
Mother ...

487
01:27:34,082 --> 01:27:38,628
are you a cat or a ghost ?

488
01:27:40,255 --> 01:27:43,424
My mother wouldn 't have turned into a ghost .

489
01:27:43,800 --> 01:27:47,219
Mother , please show yourself !

490
01:27:48,096 --> 01:27:50,765
If you 're really my mother , show yourself !

491
01:27:52,017 --> 01:27:55,603
The sword that protects you

492
01:27:56,146 --> 01:28:01,442
bars my path .

493
01:28:01,944 --> 01:28:03,819
Mother ...

494
01:28:05,072 --> 01:28:06,989
please rest in peace .

495
01:28:09,034 --> 01:28:11,327
I cut off your arm ...

496
01:28:12,079 --> 01:28:16,832
thinking an evil spirit had taken your form to deceive me .

497
01:28:17,709 --> 01:28:21,379
Please put the sword away .

498
01:28:22,297 --> 01:28:27,343
Return my arm to me .

499
01:28:28,470 --> 01:28:31,639
What do you intend to do with it ?

500
01:28:32,599 --> 01:28:36,602
My arm is my weapon .

501
01:28:37,980 --> 01:28:40,606
Without it ...

502
01:28:40,941 --> 01:28:46,654
I cannot drink the blood of samurai .

503
01:28:48,907 --> 01:28:50,992
Mother ...

504
01:28:51,994 --> 01:28:58,958
will you wander as a vengeful ghost forever ?

505
01:29:00,669 --> 01:29:05,339
Yes , I will .

506
01:29:06,383 --> 01:29:10,511
Because of my hatred for samurai ...

507
01:29:11,930 --> 01:29:17,101
for all warring samurai .

508
01:29:59,144 --> 01:30:05,733
Excuse me .

509
01:30:10,197 --> 01:30:11,530
Who 's there ?

510
01:30:12,657 --> 01:30:14,950
Please open the door .

511
01:30:17,245 --> 01:30:21,582
Tonight ends my seventh day of solitary purification .

512
01:30:22,042 --> 01:30:24,043
I cannot open the door until dawn .

513
01:30:25,378 --> 01:30:28,422
I am well aware of that .

514
01:30:29,424 --> 01:30:32,593
I am a seer

515
01:30:32,719 --> 01:30:37,181
in charge of divination at the imperial palace .

516
01:30:38,767 --> 01:30:41,977
I cannot disobey the precepts for anyone .

517
01:30:43,522 --> 01:30:48,609
The emperor is deeply concerned about you .

518
01:30:49,277 --> 01:30:53,364
As tonight is your last night ,

519
01:30:53,490 --> 01:30:58,119
evil spirits may appear to interfere with your purification .

520
01:30:58,912 --> 01:31:03,124
The emperor sent me here to bind the evil spirits

521
01:31:03,250 --> 01:31:06,168
so that you may complete

522
01:31:06,294 --> 01:31:10,381
your purification without incident .

523
01:31:12,300 --> 01:31:14,969
Go back and inform the emperor

524
01:31:15,137 --> 01:31:18,931
that Gintoki is a match for any evil spirit .

525
01:31:20,142 --> 01:31:24,061
You don 't seem to understand .

526
01:31:24,729 --> 01:31:27,731
Disobey the emperor ...

527
01:31:27,983 --> 01:31:33,779
and both you and your master Raiko

528
01:31:33,989 --> 01:31:36,615
will be punished .

529
01:31:40,745 --> 01:31:43,998
It will only take a short while .

530
01:31:44,791 --> 01:31:47,001
Please open the door .

531
01:31:48,837 --> 01:31:51,922
Very well , but only for a little while .

532
01:32:31,087 --> 01:32:36,008
Forgive me for calling so late at night .

533
01:32:42,140 --> 01:32:47,311
Is that the arm you cut off the ghost ?

534
01:32:49,773 --> 01:32:52,733
Please perform your divination and purification .

535
01:32:53,068 --> 01:32:57,404
No , I cannot go near it .

536
01:32:58,240 --> 01:33:02,576
That altar is consecrated to the god that you worship .

537
01:33:04,704 --> 01:33:07,957
I divine according to the Way of Yin and Yang ,

538
01:33:08,792 --> 01:33:13,337
the cosmic principles of dark and light .

539
01:33:15,465 --> 01:33:20,594
Please allow me a closer look at the arm .

540
01:33:21,263 --> 01:33:25,602
Please be so kind as to bring it here .

541
01:33:34,234 --> 01:33:36,568
This is all very troublesome .

542
01:34:12,272 --> 01:34:15,691
May I take it in my hand ?

543
01:34:17,861 --> 01:34:18,861
If you wish .

544
01:34:37,672 --> 01:34:40,007
What happened to your left arm ?

545
01:34:42,677 --> 01:34:44,511
It 's mine again !

546
01:36:09,681 --> 01:36:10,722
Specter !

547
01:37:51,699 --> 01:38:01,875
Mother !

548
01:39:33,426 --> 01:39:38,805
THE END

